### Page 1 of 12

```text
RESOLUTION NO. ___________

ENTITLED: “A RESOLUTION AUTHORIZING THE CITY OF CHEYENNE COMMUNITY
RECREATION AND EVENTS DEPARTMENT TO APPLY FOR A CHEYENNE
COMMUNITY RECREATION DISTRICT RECREATION MILL GRANT TO
PURCHASE SCOREBOARDS AND SOUND SYSTEMS FOR THE CHEYENNE
JUNIOR LEAGUE ATHLETIC COMPLEX.”

WHEREAS, the Cheyenne Community Recreation District receives funds from the recreation
mill levy pursuant to Wyo. Stat. § 18-9-201(b); and

WHEREAS, up to 15% of the funds are available competitively to governmental recreation
organizations for public recreation projects; and

 WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne Community Recreation and Events Department is applying
for a grant in the amount of $100,000.00 from the Cheyenne Community Recreation District Board of
Trustees to purchase scoreboards and sound systems for the Cheyenne Junior League Athletic Complex;
and

WHEREAS, if funded, the bidding process will begin immediately so that the purchase can be
made and installation will be completed during the Fall 2021 season.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the Governing Body supports this project and authorizes the City
of Cheyenne Community Recreation and Events Department to apply for grant funding in the amount of
$100,000.00 through the Cheyenne Community Recreation District Recreation Mill Grant program for
Fiscal Year 2021 – Fiscal Year 2022 to purchase scoreboards and sound systems for the Cheyenne Junior
League Athletic Complex.

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the Mayor and City Clerk are authorized to execute all
documents, including a grant agreement, to secure funding under the Cheyenne Community Recreation
District to the extent that such documents are consistent with this Resolution.

PRESENTED, READ, AND ADOPTED this ________day of __________________, 2021.

__________________________________________

Patrick J. Collins, Mayor

(SEAL)
Attest:

_____________________________________
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
By Michael R. O'Donnell at 12:42 pm, Jun 23, 2021
```

