### Page 3 of 12

```text
City of Cheyenne   |   Community Recreation & Events   |   2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, WY 82001   |   307.638.4375

June 1, 2021

Cheyenne Community Public Recreation District Board:

We are pleased to submit this grant application to purchase scoreboards and sound systems at
Cheyenne Junior League Ball Complex.  As you are aware, the City and Laramie County School
District #1 have been partnering to make improvements at this complex in order to host the
District’s new High School Girls Softball program.  The program launched this spring, and other than
uncooperative weather, I believe the inaugural season was a success.  Adding the scoreboards and
sound system enhancement is the next step in renovating this complex.

The project will follow the city’s bidding process and we will oversee the implementation of the
project.

If you have questions or need additional information about our application, please contact me.

Thank you for your consideration of this application, for your many years of past support, and for
our ongoing partnership.

Sincerely,

Teresa Moore
Director
```

